{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Merit-Systems/x402scan/issues/1197","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Merit-Systems/x402scan","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Merit-Systems/x402scan/issues/1197/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Merit-Systems/x402scan/issues/1197/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Merit-Systems/x402scan/issues/1197/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Merit-Systems/x402scan/issues/1197","id":5454101491,"node_id":"I_kwDOP1g5L88AAAABRRb78w","number":1197,"title":"Registered Base x402 API is live; looking for first buyer/canary path","user":{"login":"salmanabjam","id":143514528,"node_id":"U_kgDOCI3boA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/143514528?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/salmanabjam","html_url":"https://github.com/salmanabjam","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/salmanabjam/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/salmanabjam/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/salmanabjam/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/salmanabjam/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/salmanabjam/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/salmanabjam/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/salmanabjam/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/salmanabjam/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/salmanabjam/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-09-14T20:11:44Z","updated_at":"2026-09-14T20:11:44Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Hi Merit Systems team,\n\nWe have registered a live x402 v2 API on Base and x402scan now accepts it without compatibility warnings.\n\nService: BiX Creator Edge\nOrigin: https://bix-creator-edge.liara.run\nOpenAPI: https://bix-creator-edge.liara.run/openapi.json\nPaid route: https://bix-creator-edge.liara.run/paid/v1/creator-edge\nPrice: 0.005 USDC\nNetwork: Base (eip155:8453)\n\nThe endpoint returns a standard 402 challenge with Base USDC and includes request + response schemas in OpenAPI.\n\nWe are looking for the first real buyer/design partner or a tiny paid canary to validate the full commercial loop. Settlement is intentionally safety-gated off until a real buyer is ready, so no funds are at risk during discovery.\n\nIs there a recommended buyer-facing path in x402scan / AgentCash / Merit tooling to get a newly registered endpoint its first real paid call?\n\nThanks,\nSalman / BiX","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Merit-Systems/x402scan/issues/1197/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Merit-Systems/x402scan/issues/1197/timeline","performed_via_github_app":{"id":1144995,"client_id":"Iv23liVemv8A9if9v0F2","slug":"chatgpt-codex-connector","node_id":"A_kwHOAOQ6Gs4AEXij","owner":{"login":"openai","id":14957082,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjE0OTU3MDgy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14957082?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai","html_url":"https://github.com/openai","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/subscriptions"